  "description": "The Debug build of SdlVulkan.Renderer, for Debug consumers that need the #if DEBUG types (GpuFaultInjection and the diagnostics), which the Release SdlVulkan.Renderer package does not contain. The DebugInspector itself is in the Release package too, inert unless DIR_INSPECTOR=1 and DIR_INSPECTOR_TOKEN are set. Same version as SdlVulkan.Renderer. Reference SdlVulkan.Renderer when the configuration is not Debug and SdlVulkan.Renderer.Debug when it is, with a Configuration-conditioned PackageReference; Visual Studio needs a restore after switching configuration.",
  "id": "SdlVulkan.Renderer.Debug",
